# Godot writes LF and reads LF on every platform. Windows checkouts default to
# converting text files to CRLF (core.autocrlf=true), which rewrites every
# script and scene the moment the repo is cloned and turns the first diff on a
# new machine into the whole project.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Everything Godot stores as bytes. Marked so git never tries to normalise line
# endings inside them or offer a line diff of a spritesheet.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.webp binary
*.svg binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
*.mp3 binary
*.ogg binary
*.wav binary
*.pck binary
